---
layout: base.njk
trackId: act
title: "ACT Math · ClipSAT"
description: "All 60 questions — pre-algebra through trigonometry"
isRtl: false
---
{#
  Renders from content/act/* (docs/CONTENT_MODEL.md) instead of the legacy
  {% include "tracks/act.html" %} — ninth track cut over, following the established pattern
  (docs/DECISIONS/0005-qudrat-cutover.md, 0006, 0007, 0008). index.html's act-* sections and
  src/_includes/tracks/act.html are UNCHANGED and no longer read by this page, kept as the
  rollback path. build.js's MIGRATED_TRACKS set skips regenerating this file.

  Notes (WP20): subject-head's real source has class="subject-head act" (not the plain
  "subject-head" some tracks use) — subject-head.njk's unconditional {{ trackId }} suffix
  matches this exactly since trackId is literally 'act', so no override needed; .subject-head.act
  has a real CSS rule (::after{content:"∑"}). The real eyebrow is empty (<span class="eyebrow">
  with no text) — pageHeader.eyebrow is intentionally omitted below to match. Downloads card
  uses real docxCardLabel/docxCardTitle overrides (added this PR, docs/DECISIONS/0008-adjacent
  fix) since this track's DOCX card describes the practice set specifically, not the whole
  chapter content.
#}
{% set act = migratedContent.act %}
{% set pageHeader = act.meta.meta.pageHeader %}
<main id="view-act" class="view">
  {% include "partials/subject-head.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap calc-body">
    {% set chapters = act.chapters %}
    {% set practiceSetId = 'act-practice' %}
    {% set testGeneratorId = 'act-testgen' %}
    {% set downloadsId = 'act-downloads' %}
    {% include "partials/rail.njk" %}

    <div class="content">
      {% for chapter in act.chapters %}
        {% include "partials/chapter.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% set sectionId = 'act-practice' %}
      {% set practiceSet = act.practiceSet %}
      {% include "partials/practice-set.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'act-testgen' %}
      {% set testGenerator = act.meta.meta.testGenerator %}
      {% include "partials/test-generator.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'act-downloads' %}
      {% set courseMeta = act.meta.meta %}
      {% include "partials/downloads-block.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
